OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny mist and fog should soon
OL,6,Fclear, leaving hazy sunshine for much
OL,7,Fof the day. However, outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fmy develop and push northwards across
OL,9,Feast coastal areas during the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry and largely clear
OL,13,Fevening, but cloud will gradually
OL,14,Fbuild from the south overnight,
OL,15,Fbecoming widespread and likely
OL,16,Fbringing a few outbreaks of drizzle by
OL,17,Fdawn. Dull in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
