OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FRather dull with patchy
OL,6,Fdrizzle at first, though brightening
OL,7,Fquickly with widespread afternoon
OL,8,Fsunshine. Becoming very warm, with an
OL,9,Funusually warm night to follow. Breezy
OL,10,Fduring the evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBreezy
OL,13,Fwith rain on Wednesday, clearing to
OL,14,Fsunny spells. Further rain on
OL,15,FThursday, mainly east, followed by
OL,16,Fafternoon showers. Sunny spells and
OL,17,Fafternoon showers on Friday.
OL,18,FTemperatures closer to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
